# 17. Date Calculations

Python allows us to perform calculations with dates.

```python
import datetime

today = datetime.date.today()

future = today + datetime.timedelta(days=7)

print("Today:", today)
print("After 7 days:", future)
```

Example:

```text
Today: 2026-09-01
After 7 days: 2026-09-08
```

---

# 18. Difference Between Dates

```python
import datetime

date1 = datetime.date(2026, 9, 1)
date2 = datetime.date(2026, 9, 15)

difference = date2 - date1

print(difference.days)
```

Output:

```text
14
```

So there are 14 days between the two dates.

